+/**
+ * Check whether the variable is an object and all its properties are one or more values
+ * that satisfy the specified validator(s):
+ *
+ * @example
+ * ignoreProperties = {
+ *   value1: ["item11", "item12", "item13"],
+ *   value2: "item2",
+ * };
